please stick to this deadline.

11:00.320 --> 11:04.240
So depending on your study program, if you have a larger module which blocks the whole

11:04.240 --> 11:09.960
class, please come to us, talk to us and we will see if you find an extension for that

11:09.960 --> 11:13.560
deadline but then there's something which holds for the whole course and not just for

11:13.560 --> 11:14.560
individual people.

11:14.560 --> 11:20.480
We try to make it fair and not punish people who do their job on time.

11:20.480 --> 11:21.740
So please stick to this deadline.

11:21.740 --> 11:25.500
But if there's a serious reason why something cannot happen, feel free to talk to us but

11:25.500 --> 11:29.460
please do this early in time, a little bit ahead, not just the day of the deadline.

11:29.460 --> 11:33.140
Then it's too late to change anything.

11:33.140 --> 11:38.040
The thing is why homework assignments are important is because first, for your own studying,

11:38.040 --> 11:41.660
they kind of deepen your knowledge and make you able to implement the systems on your

11:41.660 --> 11:43.480
own, at least in basic concepts.

11:43.480 --> 11:46.420
This gives you a deeper understanding of what's going on.

11:46.420 --> 11:50.220
And also from a formal aspect, we are using this homework assignments as the basic for

11:50.220 --> 11:51.220
