11:51.220 --> 11:57.820
So in order to participate in the exam, you need to earn 50% of the points of those homework

11:57.820 --> 11:58.820
assignments.

11:58.820 --> 12:02.860
So every homework assignment gives you a certain number of points and you need to get on average

12:02.860 --> 12:10.580
50% of the points averaged over all the homework assignments of this term.

12:10.580 --> 12:15.880
It's not very hard to achieve but still requires some work and even below this 50% you're not

12:15.920 --> 12:17.840
